### ==========================================
### SCHOOLS API REQUESTS
### ==========================================
@scienceId = f202bd75-b91f-45a4-a755-37f27f912ca3
@departmentId = 78e358e9-fa4d-4e9b-a556-070dcac0a6ab

### 1. Create a School
POST http://localhost:5000/api/schools
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "School of Education",
  "code": "SSAT",
  "description": "School focused on computing and modern technologies",
  "isActive": true
}

### 2. Get All Schools
GET http://localhost:5000/api/schools

### 3. Get Active Schools
GET http://localhost:5000/api/schools/active

### 4. Search Schools by Name
GET http://localhost:5000/api/schools/search?q=School

### 5. Get School by Code
GET http://localhost:5000/api/schools/code/SSAT

### 6. Get School by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/schools/{{scienceId}}

### 7. Get School with Relations (Departments & Users)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/schools/{{scienceId}}/relations

### 8. Get All Schools with Relations
GET http://localhost:5000/api/schools/with-relations/all

### 9. Update School
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/schools/{{scienceId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name":"School of Science and Applied Technology",
  "code": "SSAT"
}

### 10. Delete School
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/schools/{{scienceId}}


### ==========================================
### SCHOOL DEPARTMENTS API REQUESTS
### ==========================================

### 11. Create a Department
POST http://localhost:5000/api/schools/departments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "schoolId": "{{scienceId}}",
  "name": "Department of Computing and Informatics",
  "code": "DCIT",
  "description": "Department offering computer science and IT courses",
  "isActive": true
}

### 12. Get All Departments
GET http://localhost:5000/api/schools/departments/

### 13. Search Departments by Name
GET http://localhost:5000/api/schools/departments/search?q=Computing

### 14. Get Department by Code
GET http://localhost:5000/api/schools/departments/code/DCIT

### 15. Get Departments by School ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/schools/departments/school/{{scienceId}}

### 16. Get Active Departments by School ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/schools/departments/school/{{scienceId}}/active

### 17. Get All Departments with Relations
GET http://localhost:5000/api/schools/departments/with-relations/all

### 18. Get Department by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/schools/departments/{{departmentId}}

### 19. Get Department with Relations (School & Users)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/schools/departments/{{departmentId}}/relations

### 20. Update Department
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/schools/departments/{{departmentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Updated department description"
}

### 21. Delete Department
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/schools/departments/{{departmentId}}